  "abstract": "Run and operate Traefik Proxy as the TLS and auth front of self-hosted LLM endpoints. Covers Docker Compose installs, routers, services and the Docker and file providers, middlewares (forwardAuth, basicAuth, ipAllowList, rateLimit), Let's Encrypt, streaming-safe timeouts for SSE, logs and metrics, v3 upgrades and troubleshooting.",
